[2026-09-29 10:14:59] [ERROR] ! NAUKRI PLATFORM RESPONSE: 'Jobs 2 Companies Services 1 Search jobs here 45 2 There was an error while processing your request, please try again later Urgent Requirement - (Python + React) Full Stack Engineer - BI-IEEIE Bounteous 3.11.1K Reviews 5 - 8 years Not Disclosed Hybrid Bengaluru, Hyderabad, Chennai Send me jobs like this Posted: 1 day ago Openings: 1 Applicants: 100+ Save Apply Job highlights 5+ years experience with Python backend (Django/Flask/FastAPI), ReactJS frontend, and AWS cloud services Design, develop, and maintain scalable backend APIs, build responsive React applications, deploy and support AWS cloud infrastructure, and participate in full product lifecycle Job match score Early Applicant Keyskills Location Work Experience Job description  Hello Everyone,     Greetings from Bounteous!!     We have an excellent Opening for the below Skills:     Job Title: Full Stack Engineer  Experience: 5+Years  Primary Skills: Python + Django+ React Js + AWS  Job Location: Chennai / Bangalore / Hyderabad / Gurugram     Kindly share the updated Profile to shanmuga.priya@bounteous.com along with the below details,     Current CTC:  Expected CTC:  Available Time to Join:  Preferred Location:  The Role in Brief     We are looking for a Full Stack Engineer with strong hands-on experience across Python backend development, ReactJS frontend development, and AWS cloud engineering to join a product engineering team building and scaling modern, cloud-based web applications.  The ideal candidate should have solid Backend Engineering (BED) and Frontend Engineering (FED) experience, along with practical exposure to designing, deploying, and supporting applications on AWS. You will contribute across the full product lifecyclefrom technical design and development through testing, deployment, troubleshooting, and production support.  Key Responsibilities  Backend Engineering (BED)  Design, develop, and maintain scalable backend services and REST APIs using Python. Work with frameworks such as Django, Flask, or FastAPI. Design and implement data models, business logic, integrations, and APIs. Work with PostgreSQL/MySQL and optimize database queries and application performance. Write clean, maintainable, testable code with appropriate unit and integration testing. Troubleshoot production issues and contribute to performance, reliability, and scalability improvements.  Frontend Engineering (FED)  Build responsive and scalable web applications using ReactJS and TypeScript/JavaScript. Develop reusable components and maintain frontend architecture and coding standards. Integrate frontend applications with REST APIs and backend services. Implement state management, form handling, validation, and error handling. Collaborate with UX/design teams to translate requirements into high-quality user experiences. Ensure cross-browser compatibility, performance, accessibility, and responsive design.  AWS / Cloud Engineering  Design, deploy, and support applications and services on AWS. Work with AWS services such as EC2, ECS/EKS, Lambda, S3, RDS, CloudWatch, IAM, VPC, and API Gateway. Support containerized application deployments using Docker and Kubernetes/ECS where applicable. Build and maintain CI/CD pipelines using tools such as GitHub Actions, Jenkins, GitLab CI, or AWS-native services. Implement cloud security, monitoring, logging, scalability, and reliability best practices. Troubleshoot infrastructure and application issues across development, staging, and production environments.  Technical Ownership  Translate product requirements into technical designs, tasks, and implementation plans. Participate in architecture and design discussions across backend, frontend, and cloud components. Identify technical risks, dependencies, and opportunities for performance and scalability improvements. Participate in code reviews and maintain engineering standards. Contribute to technical documentation and knowledge sharing.  Agile Collaboration  Work closely with technical leads, architects, product managers, QA, DevOps, and other engineering teams. Participate in sprint planning, daily stand-ups, demos, retrospectives, and technical discussions. Collaborate effectively with cross-shore and distributed engineering teams. Communicate technical decisions, progress, risks, and dependencies clearly.  Basic Qualifications  47 years of professional software development experience with strong full-stack engineering exposure. Strong hands-on experience with Python backend development using Django, Flask, or FastAPI. Strong hands-on experience with ReactJS and modern JavaScript/TypeScript. Practical experience building and integrating REST APIs. Strong experience with PostgreSQL, MySQL, or similar relational databases. Hands-on experience with AWS cloud services and deploying/supporting applications in AWS. Experience with Docker and CI/CD pipelines. Strong understanding of Git, branching strategies, code reviews, and software development practices. Experience with unit, integration, and API testing. Strong debugging, problem-solving, and troubleshooting skills. Good written and verbal communication skills.  Preferred Qualifications  Experience building production-grade Python + React applications end-to-end. Experience with Django REST Framework, FastAPI, or similar API frameworks. Experience with TypeScript, modern React patterns, and frontend state management. Experience with AWS ECS/EKS, Lambda, RDS, S3, CloudWatch, IAM, VPC, and API Gateway. Experience with Docker/Kubernetes and infrastructure automation. Exposure to Terraform or CloudFormation. Experience designing scalable, secure, and highly available cloud architectures. Experience working with distributed/global engineering teams. Strong understanding of application security, observability, performance optimization, and production support. Experience working in Agile/Scrum product development environments. Ability to take ownership of features across BED, FED, and AWS/cloud components.     Role: Full Stack Developer Industry Type: IT Services & Consulting Department: Engineering - Software & QA Employment Type: Full Time, Permanent Role Category: Software Development Education UG: B.Tech / B.E. in Any Specialization, B.Sc in Any Specialization  read more  Key Skills Skills highlighted with ‘‘ are preferred keyskills DjangoAWSReactPython Report this job About the company Bounteous PrivateIT Services & ConsultingHighly Rated by WomenForeign MNCB2B Following 521.2k followers Overview  Bounteous is a global AI Services firm where agentic engineering and human experience converge to deliver transformative business outcomes for the enterprise. We help organizations design, build, and scale AI-driven products, platforms, and processes. With more than 5,000 team members worldwide, Bounteous helps organizations take AI from experimentation to enterprise scale. Bounteous is backed by New Mountain Capital, a New York-based growth-oriented investment firm that emphasizes business building.   Discover more about our impactful work and expertise by visiting www.bounteous.com.  read more Grow With Us Amplify Your Digital Influence-Be part of groundbreaking, end-to-end digital transformations for the world’s most ambitious companies. Expand Your Horizons-Unlock global opportunities to grow and lead with clear paths and support to achieve your goals. Elevate Your Impact-Thrive as your whole self in an inclusive, high-performance organization that values and supports you. read more Company Info Link: Bounteous website Address: Chicago Beware of imposters! Naukri.com does not promise a job or an interview in exchange of money. Fraudsters may ask you to pay in the pretext of registration fee, Refundable Fee…Read more Bounteous roles you might be interested in Software Engineer 3-5 Yrs Hybrid - Bengaluru Posted 1 day ago AI Generative Full Stack Developer | L-A-IIEBH 5-10 Yrs Hybrid - Bengaluru, Gurugram, Chennai Posted 