Engineers and ML/MLOps Engineers on AI-powered products.  Core Technical Skills  Python and FastAPI. React and modern JavaScript/TypeScript. REST API development and API integration. HTML5, CSS3 and responsive UI development. SQL and database fundamentals. Git and Git-based development workflows. Understanding of authentication, authorization and web security. Strong debugging and problem-solving skills.  Preferred / Additional Skills  Pydantic and SQLAlchemy. PostgreSQL, MySQL or MariaDB. MongoDB. Redis for caching/session/rate-limiting use cases. Celery/RQ for background jobs. Nginx or Caddy. Docker and Docker Compose. Playwright, Vitest/Jest, Pytest. OpenAPI/Swagger. WebSockets. GraphQL. Kafka or RabbitMQ. AI/ML API integration using FastAPI. Basic Kubernetes and CI/CD exposure.  Open-Source Technology Stack  Python FastAPI Pydantic SQLAlchemy React TypeScript Vite PostgreSQL MongoDB Redis Celery / RQ Nginx / Caddy Docker / Docker Compose Pytest Playwright / Vitest OpenAPI / Swagger Kafka / RabbitMQ Git Linux  Ideal Candidate Profile  The ideal candidate should be able to independently develop a feature end-to-end—from React UI and API design to database integration, testing, containerization and deployment. Experience integrating AI/ML/LLM capabilities into web applications will be an additional advantage.  Key Skills  Python | FastAPI | Pydantic | SQLAlchemy | React | TypeScript | Vite | PostgreSQL | MongoDB | Redis | Celery / RQ | Nginx / Caddy | Docker / Docker Compose | Pytest | Playwright / Vitest | OpenAPI / Swagger | Kafka / RabbitMQ | Git | Linux  Role: Full Stack Developer Industry Type: IT Services & Consulting Department: Engineering - Software & QA Employment Type: Full Time, Permanent Role Category: Software Development Education UG: Any Graduate Key Skills Skills highlighted with ‘‘ are preferred keyskills generative aiFast APIReact.jsPythonSQL Agentic AiFullstack DevelopmentJavascriptKubernetes Report this job About company  Kolkata  Company Info 